    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659980/extras/8781fbfd05fde9550f2362f45e5518eb.avif?t=1747501016\" data-has-big width=800 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It all starts with a chance encounter\u2014just you, the summer sun, and a girl named Charlotte who seems to shine a little brighter than the rest. After that, things take off through phone messages: late-night chats, playful teasing, and those little heart-pounding moments when she replies a bit <i>too</i> quickly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your bond grows, so does the heat\u2014literally and figuratively. You\u2019ll go on a few dates, make choices that shape your relationship, and experience the sweet awkwardness of early romance mixed with the thrill of wondering what might happen next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With light clicker mechanics to keep things snappy and just enough flirtation to make you blush, this summer story builds toward a steamy climax that\u2019s all about chemistry, connection, and maybe, just maybe\u2026 more than a crush.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659980/extras/1a0d0bc8f6c6c887c9cac13e91a75fb7.avif?t=1747501016\" data-has-big width=800 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charlotte is bright, bold, and impossible to ignore. With sun-kissed blonde hair, sparkling blue eyes, and a smile that dares you to keep up, she\u2019s equal parts charm and mischief. Flirty, vibrant, and just a little bit taunty\u2014she knows how to keep your heart racing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659980/extras/a243015afdf80acd48061ba51b65b463.avif?t=1747501016\" data-has-big width=800 height=1028 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The project uses a voice over pack by Nariko Nabi (Twitter: @NariAudios) from @OpenNSFWSP</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659980/extras/8781fbfd05fde9550f2362f45e5518eb.avif?t=1747501016\" data-has-big width=800 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It all starts with a chance encounter\u2014just you, the summer sun, and a girl named Charlotte who seems to shine a little brighter than the rest. After that, things take off through phone messages: late-night chats, playful teasing, and those little heart-pounding moments when she replies a bit <i>too</i> quickly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your bond grows, so does the heat\u2014literally and figuratively. You\u2019ll go on a few dates, make choices that shape your relationship, and experience the sweet awkwardness of early romance mixed with the thrill of wondering what might happen next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With light clicker mechanics to keep things snappy and just enough flirtation to make you blush, this summer story builds toward a steamy climax that\u2019s all about chemistry, connection, and maybe, just maybe\u2026 more than a crush.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659980/extras/1a0d0bc8f6c6c887c9cac13e91a75fb7.avif?t=1747501016\" data-has-big width=800 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charlotte is bright, bold, and impossible to ignore. With sun-kissed blonde hair, sparkling blue eyes, and a smile that dares you to keep up, she\u2019s equal parts charm and mischief. Flirty, vibrant, and just a little bit taunty\u2014she knows how to keep your heart racing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/app